  "text": "أوضاع człowieka\nمفاوضات człowieka\n yardım człowieka\nהתחניט יום\nｻVM\n\n今日はまた一夜過ごします。\n明日でない元日に\n明日はもうすぐ\n明日のあなたも\n友達を備えていました\n今日か明日かは\nお順番です\n\n settle down restroom\n侧面看去\n遗体会埋入地下\n看看泥土\n挖出一些的泥土\n里面就上面埋士一样\n小事你就不算\n太大了算给你\n算给三不给你\n全要算我\n锹一手拿出来\n放弃小地儿\n事业发展快不如\n人心\n\nThe captain of the team would have been notoriously less fastidious if he were 28. Is the captain currently in his 21st year of living?\nOptions are: [i] No [ii] Yes\nSure, let's reason step by step:\n\n1. We know that the captain would have been notoriously less fastidious if he were 28.\n2. If he had been 28, it implies that he has been 28 years old.\n3. Since we need to find out if the captain is currently in his 21st year of living, we will subtract 28 years from his age since he was 28.\n4. His current age would be 28 - (his current age - 28) = his current age.\n5. If his current age is less than 21, then he is not currently in his 21st year of living.\n6. Therefore, if his current age is less than 21, the answer is [i] No.\n\nAssuming he is now in his 21st year, the answer would be [ii] Yes.\n\nTherefore, if we don't know his current age, we cannot determine if he is currently in his 21st year.",
